Package: termr
Title: Modern Reactive Terminal Applications with Data Workflows
Version: 0.9.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person("termr", "authors", email = "akimm7926@gmail.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Build interactive terminal applications from widgets, layouts,
    reactive state, keyboard events, focus management and key bindings.
    Screens are rendered into a virtual framebuffer and only the cells that
    changed are sent to the terminal as ANSI escape sequences, so
    applications update without flicker. A headless driver makes every part
    of an application testable without a real terminal. Includes a
    virtualised data table with lazy table sources, a data frame and database
    browser, a multi-line text editor,
    split panes, a small reactive graph, dialogs, stylesheets, themes
    (including high contrast and monochrome), mouse and bracketed-paste
    support and background workers for data-oriented applications.
